{
  "name": "Automated B2B Vendor Security & Trust Center Audit (Webhook -> Apify -> Slack/CRM)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated B2B Vendor Security & GRC Audit\n\nAudit any B2B prospect or vendor domain in seconds for **Trust Centers (Vanta, Drata, SafeBase, Secureframe)**, **DMARC/SPF/CAA/MX email security**, **TLS health**, and **SOC 2 / ISO 27001** public signals.\n\n### Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Create a free [Apify account](https://apify.com/durative_hairstreak/b2b-vendor-security-auditor) and copy your **Personal API Token** (`Settings -> Integrations`).\n2. In the **Audit Vendor Security & Trust Center** node, create a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - **Name**: `Authorization`\n   - **Value**: `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN`\n3. Replace the Slack channel or connect your HubSpot / Salesforce / Clay CRM on the `True` branch.\n4. Send a `POST` request to the Webhook URL with JSON body: `{\"domains\": [\"linear.app\", \"vercel.com\"]}`.\n\n*Powered by [RiskOps MCP Suite](https://www.localledgerstudio.xyz/) — zero-proxy deterministic DNS/TLS auditing.*",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Branching Logic\n- **Score <= 75 (`true`)**: Weak DMARC/SPF or missing Trust Center -> route to **Security Sales / TPRM Review Alert**.\n- **Score > 75 (`false`)**: Strong security posture -> respond immediately with clean audit JSON.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-routing",
      "name": "Routing Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "vendor-security-audit",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-in",
      "name": "Receive Prospect Domains (Clay/CRM)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        320,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/durative_hairstreak~b2b-vendor-security-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"domains\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.body?.domains || ['linear.app', 'vercel.com']) }},\n  \"checkCompliancePages\": true,\n  \"checkSecurityTxt\": true,\n  \"maxPostureScore\": 100\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-sec",
      "name": "Audit Vendor Security & Trust Center",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-score-gap",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.securityPostureScore ?? 100) }}",
              "rightValue": 75,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-gap",
      "name": "Filter Security/GRC Gap Prospects (<=75)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        820,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fld-domain",
              "name": "domain",
              "value": "={{ $json.domain }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fld-score",
              "name": "securityPostureScore",
              "value": "={{ $json.securityPostureScore }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "fld-grade",
              "name": "grade",
              "value": "={{ $json.grade || 'N/A' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fld-grc",
              "name": "trustCenterPlatform",
              "value": "={{ $json.trustCenterPlatform || 'None Detected' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fld-summary",
              "name": "outreachSummary",
              "value": "={{ `[TPRM GAP] ${$json.domain} scored ${$json.securityPostureScore}/100 | Trust Center: ${$json.trustCenterPlatform || 'None'} | DMARC: ${$json.dmarcPolicy || 'Missing'}` }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-gap",
      "name": "Format High-Priority Gap Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1080,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fld-pass-domain",
              "name": "domain",
              "value": "={{ $json.domain }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fld-pass-score",
              "name": "securityPostureScore",
              "value": "={{ $json.securityPostureScore }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "fld-pass-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "PASSED_BASELINE",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-pass",
      "name": "Format Baseline Pass Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1080,
        400
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Receive Prospect Domains (Clay/CRM)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Audit Vendor Security & Trust Center",
